<title>SOUTH AFRICA: VESTACOR IN TALKS, CAUTIONS SHAREHOLDERS.</title>
<headline>VESTACOR IN TALKS, CAUTIONS SHAREHOLDERS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Vestacor Ltd said on Thursday that it was in talks that could have an effect on its share price if the negotiations prove succesful.</p>
<p>The firm urged shareholders to use caution when dealing in its shares until a further announcement is made.</p>
<p>The firm gave no other details in a brief statement.</p>
